"The maximum number of zombie transactions before the reaper escalates to "
"ERROR-level logging.\n"
"\n"
"A zombie transaction is one where the cancel worker was unable to roll it "
"back within the configured wait periods. Once this threshold is reached, "
"subsequent zombies are logged at ERROR level instead of WARN.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:"
